NOTICE — third-party fonts
==========================

This package ships three static font files under `fonts/`:

    Inter-Regular.ttf    Inter-Bold.ttf    Inter-ExtraBold.ttf

They are the Inter v20 static instances Google Fonts serves for legacy formats,
and they are NOT covered by this repository's GPL-3.0-only licence. Inter is
Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter),
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org).

They are redistributed here — rather than fetched at build time — because
`next/og` renders through satori, outside the CSS tree, and the only way one of
Motir's social cards gets a typeface at all is `ImageResponse`'s `fonts` option,
which takes font BYTES. The OFL permits this redistribution; it reserves the
Reserved Font Name "Inter", so a modified derivative must be renamed. Nothing in
this package modifies them: they are shipped byte-for-byte as obtained.

